# Regenerate with:  vhs docs/demo.tape
#
# This records the real `compare` command. The offline model is deterministic and
# the permutation sampler is seeded, so the figures below reproduce exactly on any
# machine — nothing here is edited after recording.

Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1080
Set Height 480
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Builtin Solarized Dark"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "uv run datagraph compare"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 7s
Sleep 4s
